  "contracts": [
    "trusted kernel identity authenticates principal; user message contains no principal or private pointer",
    "immutable kernel policy, private controls and declared user windows retained by one serialized privileged Thread owner",
    "incoming interrupt masks clear for memory/proof callbacks; callbacks bounded, no recursive admission/release/execute",
    "successful pin guarantees requested CPU access and mapping/process lifetime until successful unpin",
    "failed pin leaves zero references/effects; failed drain/unpin retains exact loan pointer and epoch",
    "input snapshot once; both pins before actual bounded typed GPIO; final guard orders revocation and effect",
    "operation result and cleanup result remain distinct; device_effect_possible never authorizes replay",
    "kernel-only generic drain must prove actual provider/IRQ/DMA/deferred final access and observer join",
    "closed admission plus zero loans/list and no executor establishes registered quiescence only",
    "all known controls rejected against user RAM and writable peer borrows; opaque callback state remains trusted integration responsibility"
  ],
